<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  RM_FloatstoneKeelBrace.xml        FORGE_GPT_ENRICHMENT_1 §1 — floatstone keelwork

  "Pearl-white, spun-sugar floatstone braces threaded through a gravship reduce its
  launch cost." MEASURED (RimSage 1.6): Odyssey launch cost is fuel, cut only by a
  linked gravship facility's fuelSavingsPercent (vanilla FuelOptimizer: 0.3, two per
  ship). So the brace is such a facility; Patches/RM_TheForge_KeelBraceLink.xml lists it
  on the grav engine. RM_CompKeelBrace (Source/RM_ForgeKeelwork.cs) shows the saving.
  Unlocked by RM_SpunstoneBonding, which is hidden until floatstone gardens are studied.

  TUNED, every number, not ruled: 5% fuel per brace, four per ship (20% at most, under
  one vanilla optimizer's 30%, because a brace costs no gravtech); 30 floatstone per
  brace (just under one garden's 35-block harvest); mass 3 (30 blocks at 0.1).

  PAYLOAD (FOUNDRY ruling 2026-10-03, owner may veto): the spec says braces "reduce launch cost OR raise effective
  payload". Vanilla has no payload, and "or" is satisfied by the fuel saving, so a brace adds NO SubstructureSupport.
  Adding it would stack with grav field extenders (+250 each) and change how big a ship may be, a balance lever
  nobody asked for. Each linked brace rings once at launch (RM_Patch_KeelRing, toggle keelRingEnabled).

  PLACEHOLDER ART: the floatstone block's own item texture. Bespoke brace art is owed
  (FORGE_KEELWORK_REMAINDER_1: job RM_FloatstoneKeelBrace filed in artpipe pending, not yet rendered).
-->
<Defs>
  <ThingDef ParentName="GravshipComponentBase">
    <defName>RM_FloatstoneKeelBrace</defName>
    <label>floatstone keel brace</label>
    <description>A pearl-white brace of spun floatstone, threaded through a gravship's frame along the lines its strain runs. It weighs almost nothing and gives almost nothing, so the grav engine lifts the ship with less help from its thrusters: every linked brace cuts the fuel a flight burns.\n\nA gravship can carry up to four keel braces.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <texPath>Things/Item/RM_Floatstone/RM_Floatstone</texPath>
      <drawSize>(1, 1)</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>220</MaxHitPoints>
      <Flammability>0</Flammability>
      <Beauty>2</Beauty>
      <WorkToBuild>2400</WorkToBuild>
      <Mass>3</Mass>
    </statBases>
    <costList>
      <RM_Floatstone>30</RM_Floatstone>
    </costList>
    <size>(1, 1)</size>
    <fillPercent>0.3</fillPercent>
    <passability>PassThroughOnly</passability>
    <pathCost>14</pathCost>
    <canOverlapZones>false</canOverlapZones>
    <designationCategory>Odyssey</designationCategory>
    <constructionSkillPrerequisite>6</constructionSkillPrerequisite>
    <resourcesFractionWhenDeconstructed>1</resourcesFractionWhenDeconstructed>
    <terrainAffordanceNeeded>Substructure</terrainAffordanceNeeded>
    <researchPrerequisites>
      <li>RM_SpunstoneBonding</li>
    </researchPrerequisites>
    <comps>
      <li Class="CompProperties_GravshipFacility">
        <fuelSavingsPercent>0.05</fuelSavingsPercent>
        <requiresLOS>false</requiresLOS>
        <maxSimultaneous>4</maxSimultaneous>
        <maxDistance>500</maxDistance>
      </li>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.TheForge.CompProperties_KeelBrace" />
    </comps>
    <uiOrder>2210</uiOrder>
  </ThingDef>
</Defs>
